+#### Villager professions and schedule
+
+`mobs_mc.register_villager_profession(id, definition)` registers a profession
+for the regular villager. `definition` contains `name` (translated display
+name), `texture` (texture name), `jobsite` (node name or `group:` selector),
+and `trades` (the same tiered trade table format as built-in professions).
+Register during mod initialization after depending on `mobs_mc`. Registered
+professions participate in native jobsite claiming, trading, and save/load.
+
+`mobs_mc.register_villager_activity_modifier(function(tod) ... end)` adds a
+schedule modifier. The callback receives time in 0–23999 game ticks and
+returns an activity string or `nil` to use the default schedule. Modifiers run
+in registration order; the first non-`nil` result wins. Thunderstorms always
+take precedence and send villagers to sleep.
+
 ### Help
 * Item help texts: `HELP/doc/doc_items`
 * Low-level help entry and category framework: `HELP/doc/doc`
